{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 36","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce7cb2d32377813e45ecfb938306ca64902ea02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-6x+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fb1d324dcbe00e34ae63ab8dad431052fbffd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. The obtained value, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, is an exact divisor of: \n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e92cf1f195d492577c23cc32125961b42da59504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 36 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 48 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the remainder theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce7cb2d32377813e45ecfb938306ca64902ea02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-6x+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fb1d324dcbe00e34ae63ab8dad431052fbffd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82baf1ba9c89db40ef4f46d6f38b48c237acf906.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot 3^2 - 6\\cdot 3 + m = 18 + m = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"246\" height=\"18\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6a9bd5056de0ae54bb8308a6111a1e079fae2e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = -18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, which is a divisor of only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/103451cb4a8c1fe1d83a626c8b475a34afc9e069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the given expression is a quadratic, the factored form would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7ce9a7db005290de3493595e3b4a7f661cb83580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-3)(4x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a value such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d090f356ebf6808b2213434f9c7982fd45b76429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12x+yx=-6x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c49fec5572ad1c78eaa08f224a79a137471839.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3(y)=m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. The only number that fits the first equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf07d9f0a2413768e291d1264b59b3c835e4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f79ec6f90395a33f00ea833433d88672d32b323.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=-18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />. The only choice that is a multiple of 18 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/103451cb4a8c1fe1d83a626c8b475a34afc9e069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHS